{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x1e9ce0",
      "back_en": "P-Please, no...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1e9d22",
      "back_en": "down a slope like this...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'sheer cliffside' (encosta íngreme) perde 'sheer'; 'para baixo uma encosta' soa truncado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1e9d77",
      "back_en": "if you don't go down... you won't, right...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento ambíguo na origem, mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1e9dda",
      "back_en": "A-Aaaaahhhhh!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1e9f61",
      "back_en": "Why do you have such prosperity...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'know such prosperity'→'têm' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea0cf",
      "back_en": "And so we will take everything from you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea0f9",
      "back_en": "And you will know our humiliation.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel; 'você' singular vs 'vocês' anterior, mas ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea126",
      "back_en": "Y-You're...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea132",
      "back_en": "H-Hey, are you okay?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'what's the matter'→'tudo bem' preserva sentido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea14c",
      "back_en": "It can't be... Vurai, the Vanguard...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea209",
      "back_en": "Please, Lord Vurai, give us strength!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'lend us your strength' bem traduzido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea234",
      "back_en": "...I received imperial orders.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea25a",
      "back_en": "And I will raze everything.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'lay waste to all' bem traduzido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea28a",
      "back_en": "A-Aaaaahhh!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea2bb",
      "back_en": "We had no choice--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea2f9",
      "back_en": "They took our families as hostages--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea31e",
      "back_en": "Please... have mercy--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea335",
      "back_en": "...Leave/Get out of here.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Begone'→'Saiam daqui' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea340",
      "back_en": "A-Aaaahh...!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea36f",
      "back_en": "All who oppose me will be crushed.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'stand in my way'→'se opuserem' ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea3ab",
      "back_en": "Erupt.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea3ef",
      "back_en": "this ceaseless buzzing.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea45b",
      "back_en": "No... it's not possible!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea49d",
      "back_en": "I-Impossible!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea4db",
      "back_en": "in the end!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea541",
      "back_en": "You will pay with your life! Kill him!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea587",
      "back_en": "Y-You can't be... No...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea5d2",
      "back_en": "for now. Let's rest over there.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'take a break'→'descansar' ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eaca6",
      "back_en": "granted an Akuruka like my dear brother and",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ead6e",
      "back_en": "What are you thinking about?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eae07",
      "back_en": "Akuruturuka?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Termo próprio."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eae14",
      "back_en": "The Akuruka serves as a portal to the great power.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'gate'→'portal' ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eaf34",
      "back_en": "life... An all-consuming domain of destruction...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eb09d",
      "back_en": "soul.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eb108",
      "back_en": "generals with these Akurukas have to live...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel; gênero 'essas' diverge de 'um Akuruka' anterior."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eb160",
      "back_en": "Lord Vurai's power is unrivaled.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eb190",
      "back_en": "...is a general of Yamato...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eb236",
      "back_en": "The Imperial Guard of the Right, Oshtor... and",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eb292",
      "back_en": "Which means... those two... are the same...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eb2c6",
      "back_en": "My dear brother, Lord Mikazuchi, and Lady",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eb2f2",
      "back_en": "Munechika... All chosen by the Mikado to",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'to wield' continua na próxima linha."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea083",
      "back_en": "equal rocks and words...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'rocks and words alike' = 'tanto pedras quanto palavras'; 'iguais' inverte o sentido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1ea6c9",
      "back_en": "It might be a little difficult to return to",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eab84",
      "back_en": "around it.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'surrounding it'→'ao redor' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eadb5",
      "back_en": "thing!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1eadbd",
      "back_en": "Akuruturuka.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Termo próprio."
    },
    {
